# g1 and g3 focus panes by number, and the keys then act on that pane's focused block.
file <<END
A:
	- one
B:
	- two
C:
	- three
END
keys j j <C-w> v
see │  󰋜 › B
keys g1 G <C-w> v
see 󰋜 › C › three
keys g3 x
see ✔ two
keys g1 x
quit
saved <<END
A:
	- one
B:
	- two @done({today})
C:
	- three @done({today})
END
